{"id":"4e01ee20e163d443","group":"20","path":"20/20-df-pa.md","title":"Peano 算术的公理集","display":"df-pa — Peano 算术的公理集","type":"definition","metadata":{"type":"definition","book":"Turing Computability: Theory and Applications (Soare, 2016)","book_abbrev":"20","label":"20-df-pa","aliases":["20-df-pa"],"display":"df-pa — Peano 算术的公理集","chapter":"10","section":"10.1","source_kind":"local-formalization","verification_status":"reviewed","source_reference":"§10.1 PA；本地公理展开","source_pdf_pages":[215],"source_printed_pages":[183],"depends_on":["[[20-df-formula]]","[[20-df-provable]]","[[20-df-classical-proof-system]]","[[20-df-satisfaction]]"]},"metadataError":null,"renderWarnings":[],"properties":[{"key":"type","html":"definition"},{"key":"book","html":"Turing Computability: Theory and Applications (Soare, 2016)"},{"key":"book_abbrev","html":"20"},{"key":"label","html":"20-df-pa"},{"key":"aliases","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span>20-df-pa</span></div>"},{"key":"display","html":"df-pa — Peano 算术的公理集"},{"key":"chapter","html":"10"},{"key":"section","html":"10.1"},{"key":"source_kind","html":"local-formalization"},{"key":"verification_status","html":"reviewed"},{"key":"source_reference","html":"§10.1 PA；本地公理展开"},{"key":"source_pdf_pages","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span>215</span></div>"},{"key":"source_printed_pages","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span>183</span></div>"},{"key":"depends_on","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-1\" data-note=\"0c35680c0004f5e2\" href=\"?note=0c35680c0004f5e2\" title=\"20-df-formula\">20-df-formula</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-2\" data-note=\"ea674d0eb2839a85\" href=\"?note=ea674d0eb2839a85\" title=\"20-df-provable\">20-df-provable</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-3\" data-note=\"8372bbf882660759\" href=\"?note=8372bbf882660759\" title=\"20-df-classical-proof-system\">20-df-classical-proof-system</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-4\" data-note=\"d4a7833057f5a20e\" href=\"?note=d4a7833057f5a20e\" title=\"20-df-satisfaction\">20-df-satisfaction</a></span></div>"}],"html":"\n<h2 id=\"Hypothesis\">[Hypothesis]</h2>\n<p><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\dot0,\\dot S,\\dot+,\\dot\\times\">\\(\\dot0,\\dot S,\\dot+,\\dot\\times\\)</span> 只是原四个算术语法标签的类型区分记号，不更换标签及其有效代码。它们与变量和逻辑标签不交。项位置的 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"0,S,+,\\times\">\\(0,S,+,\\times\\)</span> 沿用原记法，其构造子在下文给出。<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"x=v_0\">\\(x=v_0\\)</span>、<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"y=v_1\">\\(y=v_1\\)</span> 是不同变量；归纳模式中 x 仍遍历全部变量。</p>\n<p><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"P=P_H\">\\(P=P_H\\)</span> 为本语言上的原固定经典一阶带等号证明系统。算术标准结构的载体为 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\omega\">\\(\\omega\\)</span>；右侧自然数运算是基础集合论中的自然数运算，不是未解释的对象语言符号。</p>\n<p>直接使用：see <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-5\" data-note=\"0c35680c0004f5e2\" href=\"?note=0c35680c0004f5e2\" title=\"20-df-formula\">20-df-formula</a>；see <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-6\" data-note=\"ea674d0eb2839a85\" href=\"?note=ea674d0eb2839a85\" title=\"20-df-provable\">20-df-provable</a>；see <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-7\" data-note=\"8372bbf882660759\" href=\"?note=8372bbf882660759\" title=\"20-df-classical-proof-system\">20-df-classical-proof-system</a>；see <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-8\" data-note=\"d4a7833057f5a20e\" href=\"?note=d4a7833057f5a20e\" title=\"20-df-satisfaction\">20-df-satisfaction</a>。</p>\n<h2 id=\"Assertion\">[Assertion]</h2>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{df\\text{-}pa}\\vdash\n\\begin{gathered}\nF_{PA}:=\\{\\dot0,\\dot S,\\dot+,\\dot\\times\\},\\qquad R_{PA}:=\\varnothing,\\\\\na_{F,PA}:=\\{(\\dot0,0),(\\dot S,1),(\\dot+,2),(\\dot\\times,2)\\},\\qquad\n\\mathcal L_{PA}:=(F_{PA},R_{PA},a_{F,PA},\\varnothing),\\\\\n0:=(\\dot0,()),\\qquad S(t):=(\\dot S,(t)),\\qquad\nt+u:=(\\dot+,(t,u)),\\qquad t\\times u:=(\\dot\\times,(t,u))\n\\quad(t,u\\in\\operatorname{Term}(\\mathcal L_{PA})),\\\\\n\\mathrm{Ax}_{PA}:=\\{\n\\forall x\\ Sx\\ne0,\\quad\n\\forall x,y\\ (Sx=Sy\\to x=y),\\\\\n\\forall x\\ x+0=x,\\quad\n\\forall x,y\\ x+Sy=S(x+y),\\\\\n\\forall x\\ x\\times0=0,\\quad\n\\forall x,y\\ x\\times Sy=(x\\times y)+x\\}\\\\\n\\cup\\{\\operatorname{UC}((\\phi[0/x]\\land\n\\forall x(\\phi\\to\\phi[Sx/x]))\\to\\forall x\\phi):\n\\phi\\in\\operatorname{Form}(\\mathcal L_{PA}),\\ x\\in\\mathrm{Var}\\},\\\\\nPA:=\\{\\theta\\in\\operatorname{Sent}(\\mathcal L_{PA}):\\mathrm{Ax}_{PA}\\vdash_P\\theta\\}.\n\\end{gathered}\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\mathrm{df\\text{-}pa}\\vdash\n\\begin{gathered}\nF_{PA}:=\\{\\dot0,\\dot S,\\dot+,\\dot\\times\\},\\qquad R_{PA}:=\\varnothing,\\\\\na_{F,PA}:=\\{(\\dot0,0),(\\dot S,1),(\\dot+,2),(\\dot\\times,2)\\},\\qquad\n\\mathcal L_{PA}:=(F_{PA},R_{PA},a_{F,PA},\\varnothing),\\\\\n0:=(\\dot0,()),\\qquad S(t):=(\\dot S,(t)),\\qquad\nt+u:=(\\dot+,(t,u)),\\qquad t\\times u:=(\\dot\\times,(t,u))\n\\quad(t,u\\in\\operatorname{Term}(\\mathcal L_{PA})),\\\\\n\\mathrm{Ax}_{PA}:=\\{\n\\forall x\\ Sx\\ne0,\\quad\n\\forall x,y\\ (Sx=Sy\\to x=y),\\\\\n\\forall x\\ x+0=x,\\quad\n\\forall x,y\\ x+Sy=S(x+y),\\\\\n\\forall x\\ x\\times0=0,\\quad\n\\forall x,y\\ x\\times Sy=(x\\times y)+x\\}\\\\\n\\cup\\{\\operatorname{UC}((\\phi[0/x]\\land\n\\forall x(\\phi\\to\\phi[Sx/x]))\\to\\forall x\\phi):\n\\phi\\in\\operatorname{Form}(\\mathcal L_{PA}),\\ x\\in\\mathrm{Var}\\},\\\\\nPA:=\\{\\theta\\in\\operatorname{Sent}(\\mathcal L_{PA}):\\mathrm{Ax}_{PA}\\vdash_P\\theta\\}.\n\\end{gathered}\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\begin{gathered}\nI_{PA}(\\dot0):=\\{((),\\varnothing)\\},\\qquad\nI_{PA}(\\dot S):=\\{((n),n+1):n\\in\\omega\\},\\\\\nI_{PA}(\\dot+):=\\{((n,m),n+m):n,m\\in\\omega\\},\\qquad\nI_{PA}(\\dot\\times):=\\{((n,m),n\\cdot m):n,m\\in\\omega\\},\\\\\n\\operatorname{dom}(I_{PA})=F_{PA},\\qquad\\forall\\ell\\in F_{PA}\\ [I_{PA}(\\ell):\\omega^{a_{F,PA}(\\ell)}\\to\\omega],\\\\\n\\mathfrak N:=(\\omega,I_{PA},\\varnothing).\n\\end{gathered}\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\begin{gathered}\nI_{PA}(\\dot0):=\\{((),\\varnothing)\\},\\qquad\nI_{PA}(\\dot S):=\\{((n),n+1):n\\in\\omega\\},\\\\\nI_{PA}(\\dot+):=\\{((n,m),n+m):n,m\\in\\omega\\},\\qquad\nI_{PA}(\\dot\\times):=\\{((n,m),n\\cdot m):n,m\\in\\omega\\},\\\\\n\\operatorname{dom}(I_{PA})=F_{PA},\\qquad\\forall\\ell\\in F_{PA}\\ [I_{PA}(\\ell):\\omega^{a_{F,PA}(\\ell)}\\to\\omega],\\\\\n\\mathfrak N:=(\\omega,I_{PA},\\varnothing).\n\\end{gathered}\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><h2 id=\"Remark\">[Remark]</h2>\n<p>原六条非逻辑公理、归纳模式、全称闭包及 PA 的可证句子集合均保留。修改将原符号集合缩写展开为 formula 所要求的四元签名，并把项的构造与标准模型的解释分开。点号只区分符号与其语义值，不是重新编码或更换语言。</p>\n<p>标准结构解释表供带函数参数的算术关系及枚举博弈复用，不额外引入算术公理。</p>\n<p>来源：§10.1 PA；本地公理展开；印刷页 183；PDF 第 215 页（从 1 起）。</p>\n","headings":[{"id":"Hypothesis","text":"[Hypothesis]","level":2},{"id":"Assertion","text":"[Assertion]","level":2},{"id":"Remark","text":"[Remark]","level":2}],"links":[{"target":"20-df-formula","status":"resolved","id":"0c35680c0004f5e2","anchor":"ref-1","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[20-df-formula]]","embed":false},{"target":"20-df-provable","status":"resolved","id":"ea674d0eb2839a85","anchor":"ref-2","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[20-df-provable]]","embed":false},{"target":"20-df-classical-proof-system","status":"resolved","id":"8372bbf882660759","anchor":"ref-3","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[20-df-classical-proof-system]]","embed":false},{"target":"20-df-satisfaction","status":"resolved","id":"d4a7833057f5a20e","anchor":"ref-4","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[20-df-satisfaction]]","embe