all x,y\\ x+Sy=S(x+y),\\\\\n\\forall x\\ x\\times0=0,\\quad\n\\forall x,y\\ x\\times Sy=(x\\times y)+x\\}\\\\\n\\cup\\{\\operatorname{UC}((\\phi[0/x]\\land\n\\forall x(\\phi\\to\\phi[Sx/x]))\\to\\forall x\\phi):\n\\phi\\in\\operatorname{Form}(\\mathcal L_{PA}),\\ x\\in\\mathrm{Var}\\},\\\\\nPA:=\\{\\theta\\in\\operatorname{Sent}(\\mathcal L_{PA}):\\mathrm{Ax}_{PA}\\vdash_P\\theta\\}.\n\\end{gathered}","display":true},{"tex":"\\begin{gathered}\nI_{PA}(\\dot0):=\\{((),\\varnothing)\\},\\qquad\nI_{PA}(\\dot S):=\\{((n),n+1):n\\in\\omega\\},\\\\\nI_{PA}(\\dot+):=\\{((n,m),n+m):n,m\\in\\omega\\},\\qquad\nI_{PA}(\\dot\\times):=\\{((n,m),n\\cdot m):n,m\\in\\omega\\},\\\\\n\\operatorname{dom}(I_{PA})=F_{PA},\\qquad\\forall\\ell\\in F_{PA}\\ [I_{PA}(\\ell):\\omega^{a_{F,PA}(\\ell)}\\to\\omega],\\\\\n\\mathfrak N:=(\\omega,I_{PA},\\varnothing).\n\\end{gathered}","display":true}],"bytes":3030,"backlinks":[{"id":"67ae4f0c8e4d1ac7","anchor":"ref-6","locations":["元数据 · depends_on","正文"],"count":2,"excerpt":"直接使用：see [[20-df-formula]]；see [[20-df-satisfaction]]；see [[20-df-pa]]。"},{"id":"379df91db6a6f0af","anchor":"ref-4","locations":["元数据 · depends_on","正文"],"count":2,"excerpt":"直接使用：see [[20-df-pa]]；see [[20-df-provable]]；see [[20-df-classical-proof-system]]。"},{"id":"2772d51949360c14","anchor":"ref-12","locations":["元数据 · depends_on","正文"],"count":2,"excerpt":"直接使用：see [[20-df-finite-code]]；see [[20-df-finite-sequence-code]]；see [[20-df-pairing]]；see [[20-df-formula]]；see [[20-df-satisfaction]]；see [[20-df-pa]]。"},{"id":"96aa7c2f3c33ea30","anchor":"ref-5","locations":["元数据 · depends_on","正文"],"count":2,"excerpt":"直接使用：see [[20-df-pa]]；see [[20-df-completion]]；see [[20-df-provable]]；see [[20-df-re]]。"},{"id":"d85c7ced66d7ccee","anchor":"ref-35","locations":["正文"],"count":1,"excerpt":"[[20-df-pa]]"},{"id":"005203b6707a19f4","anchor":"ref-145","locations":["正文"],"count":1,"excerpt":"[[20-df-pa]] — 章 10；直接提供者 3 个。"},{"id":"f4368dd1e05cad1f","anchor":"ref-145","locations":["正文"],"co